id: media-controls
section: Media and sound
item: The video's control bar by finger: a tap on the video pauses it and the bar stands (and keeps standing while paused); the mute button toggles muted twice (the page reads it back); the slider drags are media-scrub-drag
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-media-test.html?src=clip60av.webm&wide=1
kit: cavekit-gre-widgets.md R1
wait rect v 20
calibrate 'sel:#status'
wait text status playing 15
tap v
wait text status 'paused' 5
measure 'anon:#v|controlBar'
measure 'anon:#v|muteButton'
measure 'anon:#v|scrubber'
measure 'anon:#v|volumeControl'
wait rect 'anon:#v|controlBar' 5
wait rect 'anon:#v|muteButton' 5
shoot controls
touch 'anon:#v|muteButton'
wait text vol 'muted=false' 5
touch 'anon:#v|muteButton'
wait text vol 'muted=true' 5
touch 'anon:#v|muteButton'
wait text vol 'muted=false' 5
shoot bar
expect visible 'anon:#v|controlBar'
dwell 3000
expect visible 'anon:#v|controlBar'
